---
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Navbar from "@/components/Navbar";
import Footer from "@/components/Footer";
import { siteConfig } from "@/config/site";
---

<BaseLayout
  title={`Account Deletion Policy & Instructions — ${siteConfig.shortName}`}
  description={`Step-by-step instructions and policy for requesting deletion of your ${siteConfig.shortName} account and associated data.`}
>
  <Navbar client:load />

  <main class="pt-[110px] pb-20 sm:pt-[130px] sm:pb-28">
    <div class="container-x max-w-4xl">
      <!-- Back Link -->
      <div class="mb-8">
        <a
          href="/"
          class="focus-ring inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-black/60 transition-colors hover:text-black"
        >
          <svg
            width="14"
            height="14"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="2.5"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"
          >
            <path d="M19 12H5"></path>
            <path d="M12 19l-7-7 7-7"></path>
          </svg>
          Back to Zera Studio
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- Header -->
      <header class="mb-12 border-b border-black/10 pb-8">
        <span class="eyebrow block mb-3">User Rights & Data Controls</span>
        <h1 class="text-3.5xl sm:text-5xl font-black tracking-tight text-black leading-tight">
          Account Deletion Policy & Instructions
        </h1>
        <div class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold text-black/60">
          <span>Effective Date: August 11, 2026</span>
          <span>•</span>
          <span>Application Package: <code class="bg-bone px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-mono text-black">com.zerastudio.app</code></span>
        </div>
      </header>

      <!-- Content -->
      <article class="space-y-10 text-[0.98rem] leading-relaxed text-black/80">
        <section class="space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-extrabold text-black tracking-tight">1. Overview</h2>
          <p>
            Users of {siteConfig.shortName} (<code class="bg-bone px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-xs font-mono text-black font-semibold">com.zerastudio.app</code>) have the right to request the deletion of their account and associated personal information.
          </p>
          <p>
            In compliance with Google Play Developer Policies, {siteConfig.shortName} provides both an <strong>in-app path</strong> to initiate account deletion and an <strong>external web/email request mechanism</strong> for users who cannot access the mobile application.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-6">
          <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-extrabold text-black tracking-tight">2. How to Request Account Deletion</h2>

          <!-- Option 1: In-App -->
          <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl border border-black/10 shadow-sm space-y-3">
            <div class="inline-block px-2.5 py-1 bg-plum/10 text-plum font-bold text-xs rounded-md uppercase tracking-wide">
              Option 1: In-App Account Deletion (Recommended)
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-black">Initiate deletion within the Android app</h3>
            <ol class="list-decimal pl-6 space-y-2 text-black/80">
              <li>Open the <strong>{siteConfig.shortName}</strong> app on your Android device.</li>
              <li>Sign in to the account you wish to delete.</li>
              <li>Go to <strong>Settings</strong> or your <strong>Account Profile</strong> page.</li>
              <li>Select <strong>Delete Account</strong>.</li>
              <li>Confirm the account deletion request when prompted.</li>
            </ol>
            <p class="text-xs text-black/60 pt-2 border-t border-black/5">
              Upon confirmation, your session will end and account data will be scheduled for permanent removal.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Option 2: Web / Email Request -->
          <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl border border-black/10 shadow-sm space-y-3">
            <div class="inline-block px-2.5 py-1 bg-black/10 text-black font-bold text-xs rounded-md uppercase tracking-wide">
              Option 2: Web & Email Support Request
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-black">Request deletion if you cannot access the app</h3>
            <p class="text-black/80">
              If you have uninstalled the application or cannot access your Android device, you may submit a manual account deletion request via email:
            </p>
            <ol class="list-decimal pl-6 space-y-2 text-black/80">
              <li>Send an email from the address registered with your {siteConfig.shortName} account.</li>
              <li>Recipient: <a href={`mailto:${siteConfig.generalEmail}`} class="text-plum font-bold underline">{siteConfig.generalEmail}</a></li>
              <li>Subject line: <code class="bg-bone px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-xs font-mono text-black font-bold">Account Deletion Request - {siteConfig.shortName}</code></li>
              <li>Provide your registered email address and display name or User ID in the message body.</li>
            </ol>
            <p class="text-xs text-black/60 pt-2 border-t border-black/5">
              Support requests will be verified to confirm account ownership and processed promptly (typically within 7 to 30 days depending on identity verification).
            </p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-extrabold text-black tracking-tight">3. Data Deleted vs. Retained</h2>
          <p>Understanding what happens when your account deletion request is completed:</p>
          
          <div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
            <div class="bg-bone p-4.5 rounded-lg border border-black/10">
              <p class="font-bold text-black text-sm text-rose">Permanently Erased Data</p>
              <ul class="text-xs text-black/70 mt-2 space-y-1.5 list-disc pl-4">
                <li>Account profile (email, user ID, auth tokens, display name)</li>
                <li>Uploaded media files and timeline configurations</li>
                <li>Saved draft projects and AI prompt history</li>
                <li>Account preferences and user configuration data</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
            
            <div class="bg-bone p-4.5 rounded-lg border border-black/10">
              <p class="font-bold text-black text-sm text-black/80">Data Retained (If Applicable)</p>
              <ul class="text-xs text-black/70 mt-2 space-y-1.5 list-disc pl-4">
                <li>Records retained strictly to comply with legal or tax obligations (if any)</li>
                <li>Fully anonymized operational metrics that cannot be linked back to an individual user or device</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-extrabold text-black tracking-tight">4. Important Notes</h2>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
            <li><strong>Permanence:</strong> Account deletion is permanent. Once completed, your saved projects and account settings cannot be recovered.</li>
            <li><strong>Unsubscribing:</strong> Uninstalling the app does not automatically delete your account; you must initiate deletion in-app or submit an email request.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-4 border-t border-black/10 pt-8">
          <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-extrabold text-black tracking-tight">5. Contact Support</h2>
          <p>
            If you have questions regarding account deletion or need assistance, contact:
          </p>
          <div class="bg-bone p-5 rounded-lg border border-black/10">
            <p class="font-bold text-black">{siteConfig.shortName} Support</p>
            <p class="mt-1">Email: <a href={`mailto:${siteConfig.generalEmail}`} class="text-plum font-semibold hover:underline">{siteConfig.generalEmail}</a></p>
            <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-black/60">Privacy Policy: <a href="/privacy-policy" class="text-plum hover:underline font-medium font-semibold">View Privacy Policy</a></p>
          </div>
        </section>
      </article>
    </div>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
